    65	\end{align}
    66	Additionally, for reasons that will be evident in the proof of \prettyref{lem:dual_matrix_psd}, we require that the dual matrix $B$ satisfies  $\norm{B} \leq \ffrac{896\sqrt{n\paren{\log k}}}{p^{\ffrac{5}{2}}}$.
