</table>
<p id="S1.SS4.SSS5.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.SS4.SSS5.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text">where we have used <math id="S1.SS4.SSS5.p3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d\leqslant 2pk/3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⩽</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d\leqslant 2pk/3</annotation></semantics></math>.
