<p id="S2.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">We already argue in discussion preceding equation <a href="#S2.E27" title="In 2.1 Constructing an optimal dual ‣ 2 Exact recovery in polynomial time using SDP ‣ Exact recovery algorithm for Planted Bipartite Graph in Semi-random Graphs" class="ltx_ref">(<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">27</span></span>)</a> that <math id="S2.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{ij}=0,\forall(i,j)\in\left(S\times S\right)\cup\left(\left(V\setminus S\right)\times\left(V\setminus S\right)\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{ij}=0,\forall(i,j)\in\left(S\times S\right)\cup\left(\left(V\setminus S\right)\times\left(V\setminus S\right)\right)</annotation></semantics></math>.
